  "keyFeatures": [
    "Single binary with embedded admin UI — no separate process, cache, or search cluster required",
    "JSON Schema draft 2020-12 for collection definitions with full Ajv validation",
    "Auto-generated admin forms from collection schemas, with visual schema builder",
    "SQLite or flat-file storage drivers, switchable without data migration",
    "Claims-based API key authentication with deny-by-default and granular delegation",
    "Streaming export/import of entire instances as reproducible tar.gz archives",
    "MCP server at /api/mcp for AI clients (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Claude Desktop)",
    "Plugin system with hooks, custom HTTP routes, admin panels, and storage providers",
    "Media library with S3-compatible bucket support, folder organization, and usage tracking",
    "Per-environment variables substituted into entry content on the way out",
    "Text search at collection, environment, or instance scope using SQLite FTS5",
    "TypeScript, Java, and Dart client SDKs published independently"
  ],
